---
import InnerLayout from '../layouts/InnerLayout.astro';
---

<InnerLayout
  title="Contact | EVO"
  description="Contact EVO for industrial automation, smart living, custom engineering and connected technical systems."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container page-hero-inner">
      <div class="page-hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">START A CONVERSATION</p>
        <h1>Have a problem worth <span>engineering?</span></h1>
        <p>Tell EVO what you are trying to build, automate, improve or connect. We can start with the problem, define the scope and shape the right technical path from there.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="contact-stack">
        <article class="contact-card"><h3>Email</h3><p><a href="mailto:info@evo.lk">info@evo.lk</a></p></article>
        <article class="contact-card"><h3>Location</h3><p>Sri Lanka</p></article>
        <article class="contact-card"><h3>Focus</h3><p>Engineering · Automation · Smart Living · Connected Systems</p></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="page-section">
    <div class="container contact-layout">
      <div class="split-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">WHAT TO SEND</p>
        <h2>Start with what you <span>need solved.</span></h2>
        <p>A useful first message does not need to be technical. Explain the problem, what exists now, what outcome you want and any major constraints such as site, time, budget or equipment.</p>
        <div class="feature-list">
          <article><span>01</span><strong>The Problem</strong><p>What is not working, missing or taking too much effort?</p></article>
          <article><span>02</span><strong>The Environment</strong><p>Factory, machine, house, building or technical site.</p></article>
          <article><span>03</span><strong>The Goal</strong><p>What should be better once the work is complete?</p></article>
          <article><span>04</span><strong>Useful Material</strong><p>Photos, videos, drawings, model numbers or existing documents.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>

      <form class="contact-form" action="mailto:info@evo.lk" method="post" enctype="text/plain">
        <label>Name<input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Your name" /></label>
        <label>Email<input type="email" name="email" placeholder="you@example.com" /></label>
        <label>Area
          <select name="area">
            <option>Industrial Automation</option>
            <option>Smart Living</option>
            <option>Custom Engineering</option>
            <option>Systems & Integrations</option>
            <option>Other</option>
          </select>
        </label>
        <label>Project / Problem<textarea name="message" placeholder="Tell us what you are trying to build, fix, automate or improve."></textarea></label>
        <button class="page-button page-button-primary" type="submit">Prepare Email ↗</button>
        <p class="form-note">This first version opens your email client. A database-backed inquiry form can replace it when the production backend is connected.</p>
      </form>
    </div>
  </section>
</InnerLayout>
